From 20426d5e37f2f6381cda83de8936bee6bf232584 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:52:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] hunt stress0: option and delay knobs, the oracle
 workload, and a diagnosis where cut_known asserts

Scratch instrumentation and tests. HUNT_OPT turns engine options, HUNT_PUBLISH_DELAY_US and HUNT_READER_DELAY_US lengthen the two sides of the forms race, the oracle test is the second defect's workload without the second form, and the cut_known assertion prints the overlay and the partition it was walking before it fires.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ZkLidS5BYuaBXVcvPAkdd
